        "original_id": "48e7dad7-a009-5002-a60a-75c12f6777bc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Barry Hogan\n- Organizations: All Tomorrow's Parties, Pontins, Britannia Jinky Jersey Ltd\n- Events: All Tomorrow's Parties Festival\n- Places: Camber Sands, England, UK\n- Roles: Curators\n\nFacts:\n- In 2001, Barry Hogan founded All Tomorrow's Parties in preparation for the first All Tomorrow's Parties Festival.\n- In 2001, Mogwai curated the line-up for the first All Tomorrow's Parties Festival.\n- The first All Tomorrow's Parties Festival took place at Pontins in Camber Sands, England.\n- Pontins is the trading name of Britannia Jinky Jersey Ltd.\n- Britannia Jinky Jersey Ltd operates holiday parks in the UK.",
